#### Go ####
coverage.out
coverage.html
# `go build` with no -o drops a binary named after the package directory.
# catalog-api/ and console/ live at the repo root, so building `./catalog-api/...`
# from the root can't produce a same-named stray file there (a real directory
# already occupies that path) -- only building a nested mcp-servers/<name>/...
# pattern from the root can, landing a same-named file at the root itself.
/catalog-api/catalog-api
/console/console
/mcp-servers/bids-mcp/bids-mcp
/mcp-servers/pricing-mcp/pricing-mcp
/mcp-servers/trust-mcp/trust-mcp
/mcp-servers/orders-mcp/orders-mcp
/bids-mcp
/pricing-mcp
/trust-mcp
/orders-mcp

